Output demo/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1240
Set Height 590
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 120ms

Hide
Type `bash demo/sessions.sh /tmp/demo && mkdir -p /home/demo/dev/api-gateway && export LANG=C.UTF-8 HOME=/home/demo CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/demo CLAUDE_RESUME_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1 PATH=$PWD:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear`
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "claude-resume"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "limiter"
Sleep 2500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
